<title>UK: BayerLB sets 200 mln stg five-year bond.</title>
<headline>BayerLB sets 200 mln stg five-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager CSFB.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BAYERISCHE LANDESBANK</p>
<p> AMT    200 MLN STG   COUPON     **	  MATURITY    28.DEC.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  **	  PAY DATE   L20.DEC.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.875     REOFFER    **	  SPREAD	+10 BP</p>
<p> NOTES	L-LONG FIRST COUPON</p>
<p>		** TO BE PRICED</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/UK/DE</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.25	SELL CONC  1.625     PRAECIP     =</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 7.0 PCT 2001 GILT</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
